<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>@ViewData["Title"] · 屎山挑战赛</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/site.css" asp-append-version="true" />
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="navbar">
        <div class="container nav-inner">
            <a class="brand" href="/">屎山挑战赛 <small>风格 · AI 测试题库</small></a>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="/">题库</a>
                <span class="sep">·</span>
                <a href="/api/topics">API</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>
    <main>
        @RenderBody()
    </main>
    <footer class="footer">
        <div class="container">
            <p>本仓库为自制 AI 测试题库(形式借鉴同名赛事),仅供测试 AI 修复 BUG 的能力,非官方内容、无版权归属声明,结果仅供测试参考。</p>
        </div>
    </footer>
    @await RenderSectionAsync("Scripts", required: false)
</body>
</html>